      "spam": false,
      "value": "I'd like to extend this idea to a full-on \"usermod\" system, where trusted users could be given limited moderation capability in any given Public instance. This limited moderation capability could include no-vote kicking, muting a user, or marking a user for further review by global hosts.\n\nSince VRChat is represented primarily by public instances, having a \"reserve\" moderation force comprised of such users would be very powerful, and lower the workload/presence required on Global Hosts.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
