  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The addition of a moderator system for The Hub, making it possible for trusted users that are well known by Admins or Devs to have Host powers ( without the HOST role ) to serve as moderation for The Hub, as most troublemakers troll in there. The ability to kick without needing to make a vote, or to mute the troublemaker for everyone in the world could be given, not the power to ban them. Every actions taken by said moderators would have to be justified either in-app, with a recording and/or on Discord in a moderator channel.",
